	(descr "SMBF / DO-219AB low-profile diode. Body 4.30 x 3.60 x 1.22 mm, overall length 5.30 mm, terminals 2.00 wide x 0.50 long (HXY H1D04065BF datasheet). Land: 1.40 x 2.20 pads on 5.10 mm centres. Numbered for the 3-pin Device:D_KKA symbol - the cathode land is split into abutting pads 1 and 2 (identical copper to a single land), pad 3 is the anode. Drop-in swap with Package_TO_SOT_SMD:TO-252-2 for the same symbol.")
